  "job_B2.3.3_20251003_114507": {
    "text": "Leofan men, ic wille cy\u00f0an eow eallum, & \u00feam huru \u00fee hit \u00e6r nystan, hwanan seo bysn \u00e6rest aras \u00fe\u00e6t\nUre Drihten gescop & geworhte Adam \u00feone forman man haligne & cl\u00e6nne & synleasne him sylfum to\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0: Estote sancti, quia et ego sanctus sum.\nLeofan men, we r\u00e6da\u00f0 on bocum \u00fe\u00e6t for Adames godnesse & for his halignesse God hine gelogode on\n& n\u00e6fre he ne swulte ne dea\u00f0 ne \u00feolode ne sar ne sorge n\u00e6fre ne gebide, n\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t he syngode.\nAc sona swa he syngode & \u00f0urh deofles lare breac forbodenes, sona God sylfa, \u00fee is ealra bisceopa\nLeofan men, bisceopas syndon to \u00feam gesette on \u00feisre worulde \u00fe\u00e6t hy georne sculon be Cristes bysene\nAnd \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re bysne \u00fee God sylf on Adame astealde, \u00fee he hine for his halignesse & for his godnesse\nAnd we l\u00e6ra\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc gefullod man sy \u00e6fter his fulluhte halig & \u00f0urh \u00fe\u00e6s halgan fulluhtes halignesse\nAnd we l\u00e6ra\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t gehwa eac \u00fea f\u00e6ste swy\u00f0e rihtlice healde & hi swy\u00f0e georne smeage gelome.\nAnd gif hwylc man \u00feonne Godes lage swa swy\u00f0e abrece \u00fe\u00e6t he hine sylfne openlice wi\u00f0 God forwyrce\nUnderstande eac cristenra manna gehwylc \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t forbod huslganges & inganges into cyrican is eal\nAnd \u00f0eah \u00e6fre swa se man sy swy\u00f0or forsingod, swa he geornor & gelomor Godes hus sece d\u00e6ges &\n& \u00e6fre, swa he hine sylfne swy\u00f0or geeadmed on his d\u00e6dbote, swa by\u00f0 his d\u00e6dbot Gode andfengre, &\nAnd ure \u00e6lc m\u00e6g be woruldlican \u00feingan eac georne gecnawan \u00fe\u00e6t gyf hwa h\u00e6f\u00f0 his hlaforde sare\nNe huru ne bi\u00f0 na gebeorhlic \u00feam \u00fee wi\u00f0 God h\u00e6f\u00f0 forworht hine sylfne ealles to swy\u00f0e mid openlicre\nAnd \u00f0onne m\u00e6g se biscop eac \u00fe\u00e6s mannes syngrina \u00feurh Godes \u00feafunge \u00fee swy\u00f0or geli\u00f0ian \u00fee \u00feus\nEala, leofan men, utan don ealle swa swa us \u00feearf is, utan helpan ure sylfra, & utan anmodlice eallum\nHe is swy\u00f0e milde & him symle sy lof & wyr\u00f0mynt \u00e6fre to worulde, amen.\nDominus igitur per Ezechielem prophetam terribiliter loquitur dicens: Fili hominis, speculatorem posui\nItem Ezechiel: Ue pastoribus qui pascebant semet ipsos et non gregem Domini.\nDe quibus et Isaias propheta loquitur dicens: Canes muti non ualentes latrare.\nItem Ezechiel: Propterea pastores audite uerbum Domini.\nHec dicit Dominus: Ecce, ego ipse super pastores requiram gregem meum de manu eorum, et cessare\nItemque propheta: Ue sacerdotibus qui comedunt peccata populi.\nAd hec igitur quis non tremescat, nisi qui uerbis diuinis non credit?\nNon simus igitur tam saxei uel tam ferrei pectoris ut nos ista uerba non terreant.\nNon simus canes muti; non simus tactiti speculatores; non simus mercenarii lupum fugientes, sed\nGregorius itaque dicit: Quum enim malorum peruersitas crescit, non solum frangi predicatio non debet",
